  "user_id": 1574,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore a Profile\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Look at the profile on the screen.\r\n\r\n2. Find the function call (for example, `createProfile(...)`).\r\n\r\n3. Count how many values are passed into the function.\r\n\r\n4. Match each value to the profile:\r\n   * Which value controls the name?\r\n   * Which value controls the image?\r\n   * Which value controls the details?\r\n\r\n5. Think about:\r\n   * What does one profile represent?\r\n   * What would need to change to show a different profile?\r\n\r\n### Reminder:\r\n- Each value passed into the function controls part of the profile\r\n- One function call creates one item",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
